ORFscape v0.1.0 — layered-ORF proteogenomics pipeline.
Version line is frozen at 0.1.0 until the paper is published; features and fixes land
on this line instead of bumping the number.
Prokaryote P0-P9 and eukaryote S1-S11 both run real data; gates, constraints and
software versions are documented in docs/PIPELINE.md, docs/PROKARYOTE.md,
docs/EUKARYOTE.md, docs/CONSTRAINTS.md, docs/VERSIONS.md. Desktop GUI driven by a
JSONL event stream.
